  "decision_conditions": [
    "No dwelling (or no part of the development) shall be first occupied until details have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority demonstrating how the development will achieve the required Biodiversity Net Gain in accordance with Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). The submitted details shall include an updated Biodiversity Metric calculation for the approved development and, where applicable, evidence of the securing of statutory biodiversity credits or equivalent off-site provision. The development shall thereafter be carried out and retained in accordance with the approved details.\r\r\r\rReason: \rTo ensure that the development delivers the required biodiversity net gain, whether on-site or through off-site provision/credits, in accordance with Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
